{"contract":"translation_surface_screen_v1","entries":[{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"9033e28221e365ad71c2304f09c36131771cae7c3dd12c3d50a72743b2949d2c","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"0941686517df2d34e312ac5dec78d9f22d6c49e0c1900d5e94cf344f1f520e6b","logical_entry_identity":"9d59b1a01af27c558fb29d2c72e41cf1c708b1add151c8f86aa02a9f210d877a","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"Let out a technopsionic wave that silences for %d turns all those affected in a radius of %d, including the user.\n\t\tThe silence chance will increase with your Steampower.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"制造一道科技灵能波，使所有受影响者（包括使用者）沉默 %d 回合，作用半径为 %d 格。\n\t\t沉默几率随蒸汽强度提高。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"0ddc24d0378227a858021280ebe25ca85512dff2e1e22911bca66e9c6f31fcc5","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"0d038609bede880814a1490657cd8e3aedfab89b6fd07ea3a5926c88c1315cc2","logical_entry_identity":"d543c8fc0b058b446353fac6453f13023f67d91143471a96b5bfbc22f8429be5","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"You build %d micro spiderbot(s) from the earthly elements around you. Spiderbots are powered by an arcane cryogenic power unit directly linked to your own power.\n\t\tSpiderbots will deal %0.2f terrene damage (physical and cold) each turn to their targets. The deep cold of the attack has 25%% chance to freeze the feet of the target, pinning it to the ground for 5 turns.\n\t\tIf a target dies, the spiderbot will jump onto a new target in range %d around you.\n\t\tIf there are multiple spiderbots on a single target and more free targets are in range they will dispatch on as many as possible.\n\t\tIf there are multiple spiderbots on a single target they attack as one, stacking their damage (with disminishing returns) and trying to freeze once.\n\t\tYou can maintain up to %d spiderbots at once and each can last up to %d turns, but spiderbots need to be in sight to be able to act.\n\t\tThe cooldown of this spell is affected by Body of Stone.\n\t\tThe damage will increase with your Spellpower.\n\n\t\tYou have currently %d spiderbot(s) up.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"你使用周围的土元素制造 %d 个迷你蜘蛛机器人。蜘蛛机器人是由和你的力量相连的奥术致冷单元驱动的。\n\t\t蜘蛛机器人每个回合会对它们的目标造成 %0.2f 寒岩（物理和寒冷）伤害。极寒的攻击有 25%% 的几率冻结目标的双脚，将他们定身 5 回合。\n\t\t如果目标被击杀了，蜘蛛机器人将会跳跃到你半径 %d 码范围内的另一个敌人身上。\n\t\t如果这个目标上有多个机器人，并且范围内还有其他空闲目标，它们会尽可能分散到更多目标上。\n\t\t如果一个目标的身上附身了多个蜘蛛机器人，它们会合为一体攻击，伤害会叠加（但收益递减），并且只进行一次冻结判定。\n\t\t你可以维持最多 %d 个蜘蛛机器人，他们最多存活 %d 回合。但是，只有在你视野范围内的蜘蛛机器人才会行动。\n\t\t这一技能的冷却时间受岩石身躯的影响。\n\t\t技能伤害受法术强度加成。\n\n\t\t你现在有 %d 个蜘蛛机器人。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"a9374dbf33939cfc1c47a73f131e9d6a13877232e9e40a00e467d263a0c93e12","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"0e44f21d61dc3af2d4d24ae6b77565039ad86e886692060e5b731fecc5c8682e","logical_entry_identity":"d10417c2875bf0bd6cf84033dd210ba0d29f0b223a16e3e3baf134c4894fa25f","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"#Target# is injected with a pathogen!","source_tag":"_t","target":"#Target#被注入了病原体！"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"9b2dd97a397f315216baa2bfb3973cbfa62922b4385b8971504d51e4d7fd962a","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"268af51a791afa894e5ab615aaf2a5d97d386e06e25c2aa4ce221db2fd34dea4","logical_entry_identity":"b2b756e820a58f5e90580bee73106281d9fe7823349695f8697946aa777a3b26","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"#{bold}#CLOGGING NO MORE!#{normal}#\nIf steam-vent congestion ails you, avail yourself of:\n \n#{italic}#[An illustration depicts a rectangular glass bottle, labelled \"DR. RAGLUK's DECLOGGING DRAUGHT\".]#{normal}#\n \nMADE WITH LOVE, CARE, AND THE PUREST MINERALS FROM THE STEAM QUARRY\n \nJust one capful will cleanse your pores, flushing toxins out with the steam!\n \nALSO EFFECTIVE FOR: Headaches, nausea, ennui, fatigue, aches and pains, and general malaise!\n \n#{italic}#[A disclaimer occupies the bottom margin of the poster, in print so small you doubt the giants would be able to read it.]#{normal}#\n \nWARNING: This product has been determined by the Council of Health Authority to be correlated with the following conditions: Inverse vertigo, increased hair flammability, non-vaporous sweating, night terrors, liver dysphoria, headaches, miner's lung, brainlock, day terrors, mitosis, visions of a great butchered being, miner's elbow, skeletal emancipation, gastrointestinal infamy, brittle kidney, pinaciphobia, decreased global speed, teleportitis, miner's tongue, merged nostrils, an ancient and foul curse, lowered steam pressure, fat burning (literal), ocular feathering, Orcish body odor, arcane disruption, gravity loss, bloodlock, malfeasance, rectal carpeting, nihilism, mid-evening terrors, knee rust, and minor clogging of the pores.","source_tag":"_t","target":"#{bold}#不再堵塞！#{normal}#\n如果蒸汽孔阻塞困扰你，请用这个来帮你：\n\n#{italic}#【一幅插图描绘着一个长方形的玻璃瓶，标签上写着“拉格卢克博士的清淤药水”。】#{normal}#\n\n用爱、关怀和蒸汽采石场最纯净的矿物质制成！\n\n只要一瓶盖的量就能清洁你的气孔，和蒸汽一道排出毒素！\n\n也对以下症状有效：头痛、恶心、倦怠、疲劳、各种疼痛，以及广泛性的不适！\n\n#{italic}#【一个备注占据了海报的底部边缘，印刷字体太小以致于你怀疑巨人们能不能看到。】#{normal}#\n\n警告：经卫生理事局评议，此产品与以下症状有相关性：反转性眩晕、毛发可燃性增加、非蒸汽性出汗、夜间惊恐发作、肝火、头痛、尘肺病、脑锁、日间惊恐发作、有丝分裂、关于巨大被宰割物的幻觉、矿工肘、关节松脱、肠胃糜烂、肾脆症、清单恐惧症、全局速度下降、随机传送症、矿工舌、鼻孔合并、某个古老又邪恶的诅咒、低蒸汽压、脂肪燃烧（字面意义）、眼部羽化、兽人体味、奥术干扰、重力丧失、血锁、渎职、直肠沉积、虚无主义、傍晚惊恐发作、膝盖生锈，以及气孔的轻微堵塞。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"c7361c70a812288a52c8300198a781d1d38bb3b378728ed01d0eaa171157b516","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"3517f6883445532555f15ca7de744683230ab814805fc030d02209af7b19fff7","logical_entry_identity":"2851b23208816e4c9e61dd3743c1379d92c0953390b2f654a6f534a7ae3afc85","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"But the worst threat comes from the peninsula itself, the main inhabitants are not the orcs, but the Atmos Tribe.","source_tag":"_t","target":"然而，最大的威胁来自半岛本身。半岛上的主要居民并非兽人，而是气之部族。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"7773cd7689e360f09958835c8b7adbddb9073d4109eafd7c461437e253e3f135","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"3a240d588952f544ce6a841e9c35df62f18a54f25a4110187c908ab3631c83f0","logical_entry_identity":"6f1c75046e632ee079d4eeee170d0a5722de7919010fd4e2e6825799d699aa2b","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"The thrill of the hunt invigorates you. For each foe in radius %d around you, you gain 20%% movement speed (up to %d%%).\n\t\tCurrent bonus: %d%%.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"狩猎的快感令你精神焕发。半径 %d 内每有一个敌人，你获得 20%% 移动速度（最多 %d%%）。\n\t\t当前加成：%d%%。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"d75f44e865303a5f8d045230e6fcd58712faedcf67669a83fdafa1eaf358af37","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"404eaa420512cdedb3817c280a7b9c395638a573646b90dd3faab1d6b546a187","logical_entry_identity":"e6010c3b0171fb80d48401124e59a652130ac618dbbf5b68f9a6af250e154006","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"He does sound well armed, though, so be prepared as it is likely very dangerous.","source_tag":"_t","target":"不过，听说他装备精良，所以请做好准备，这很可能非常危险。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"619a4ba87b945d9e19dffe4a05dca0cd39c4fc72aa1e9efe59376fbe47d77fe3","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"6353f5bbdc5e668bae4839ff166dd4ff21cc4f9ec0afc4052a86212d0ce21574","logical_entry_identity":"fcc69a446ada2260b04fd72383c556a362430da914494673e406f4ef9080be38","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"Grave strength, dread will, this flesh cannot stay still. Kings die, masters fall, we will outlast them all.","source_tag":"_t","target":"死亡的力量，恐惧的意志，这些肉体不会沉寂。国王去世，主人陨落，我们才是永生。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"fc4ff5e3e416de0df735470848421be5bd014d3ba962e8ceb0f1047f564d4ccf","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"63603acba45cc4c7c6b151ca4ca11cb9eee4de0d9e6914e933e3c8d8f6068311","logical_entry_identity":"883a9a1c766eb0fcf100ddc2bc96f417fb43758b5b63fb522a42dfdbc6c974ef","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"The tinker spends some time with you, teaching you the basics of therapeutics.","source_tag":"logPlayer","target":"工匠花费时间传授你治疗学的基础知识。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"20397c847c2b3758b846b0109dbc27442286cfe613f51a5068d1442f34f4e7ab","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"6366eb55259829f07ff3b8df48cfe92aa58329dac4b395e451e461754fd5a9bc","logical_entry_identity":"75c9d9c4fead68028eda77cb97e28fec4cd59762ca94845fb838e1dbe32df478","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"Thundercrack","source_tag":"entity name","target":"雷电打击"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"a9fca8153d3626b83186920d26eda433b1962a9b467d358ba0274bd173b85461","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"636b0aa1ef8439b5cee73e13ee2a15961a5ca9aa20fd49a331c3016d2600588a","logical_entry_identity":"cd0e5498a7c35c444b6b5bcebfbc122e784445f0990317930d45ca537b745525","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"Engaged in automated repairs, preventing any action but increasing life regen by %d, all resistances by %d%% and preventing death until falling below -%d life.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"进入自动修复模式，无法行动，但生命恢复速率增加 %d，生命值回满时立即结束该模式，全部抗性提升 %d%%，死亡生命下限为 -%d。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"22a3139f116646f66c3b882f6382ba0d4b4a7888b0806901414510c089c89075","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"63788a65e6727b12a392c62115097723779bc143ad0963abac4d6818fc72909d","logical_entry_identity":"6ba8b9d6b89a6e7335515f2b137f2c51f4c2b78c0b288fab96c9b147fc847a0a","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"Hunker Down","source_tag":"talent name","target":"炮台守卫"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"a1a3068b4f90042b69b765f30ca41016d762c01a453ba1556cac738bce0e3a97","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"6384302dfcb3b212dcb07aea5a1e2f51093727cf399487534bf9b738bdcee793","logical_entry_identity":"00bd26fec0fa889b8e8a22e2d0bb2aa37ac32698e7df8a8842bad39c7c465103","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"This bomb was tailored to weaken the structure of the Dominion's port tower. If placed at the right spot it will explode after 100 turns and destroy the whole port.","source_tag":"_t","target":"这枚炸弹是为削弱帝国港口塔楼的结构而特制的。如果放在正确的位置，它会在100回合后爆炸并摧毁整个港口。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"cdab804235e09fe1254cb7233e72dccbc5c59aa6a5a0cfa8f2e4818aa5f543d0","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"6387136859436015b8b9c1958f7a8ebb93c6171cfb80cd8fb172abdd65d37018","logical_entry_identity":"60ca63bb8fea3b1f6ce171a0a191d0a82a1c462e9e08bde7ae08fe07c34a6576","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"Dominion Port","source_tag":"_t","target":"巨魔帝国港口"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"0512bd87824d5a02912ed8cd95a267a52129fcbc2b4d257f90e58d981eb47ed6","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"6388c016f236b82113c09dd573142ee7b8e2a0f0a454c244de0dcd34b587532f","logical_entry_identity":"ee4f45b03f6248a3fa471b9b49cc66137ccaedfcfd11fd04b81b1e8176be3316","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"#Target# is trapped by the net.","source_tag":"_t","target":"#Target# 被网住了。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"d8ec3c14f86c5d8f714f940a3cd9c4c2586dde5575570e0fc0b0b9bab1039da9","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"639b4ae1003ee9143a2832e3e2150f03abdfd163069b3b57650b4e30012171ae","logical_entry_identity":"e06b72489402a112a1ddd6e05bf6a927051483a86ddf90680a05b64071443eed","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"Using psionic energies you overheat your shot, making it deal %d%% damage.\n\t\tIf the shot hits a wet foe it will vaporize, removing the wet effect and dealing %0.2f fire damage in a radius 4.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"使用灵能加热子弹，造成 %d%% 武器伤害。\n\t\t子弹命中处于浸湿状态的目标时将气化，除去浸湿状态，在半径 4 范围内造成 %0.2f 火焰伤害。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"3f2c250d6530efffe03cb9a7463429cd44bdc89ac216950a4453f06f32d1b63a","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"63c2110551a2611074c5fa2ef7cc036f6528d02bf154c2f7c664682035d2bd66","logical_entry_identity":"8a22b0b2787d0ea0df8e2c7f8bb731e30ea5f35291896f0b234eb9407ed1610b","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"Mercy, mercy!","source_tag":"achievement name","target":"慈悲为怀"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"e4ac908fafd3fc8c4cc81d48ba9312518559db75abaa61b8bbab8e7685179b1a","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"63c365c2c010e56ad1eb6236438919831fb47386ffed07d7a8cf744bda2e722f","logical_entry_identity":"f9483d82b87a195e50f8721cd6557f4